orm – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px; text-align: center; width: 71.9404%;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 71.9404%; text-align: center; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"7\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.5929%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 37.3475%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 71.9404%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px; width: 34.5929%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px; width: 37.3475%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><a title=\"BSNL JTO Registration 2026\" href=\"https://bsnlregistration.ibtexamination.com/bsnl_02.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 34.5929%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 37.3475%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><a title=\"How to Fill Form\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/yj4rnn7z